OL,3,GNEWSADisappointment as A10 removed from
OL,4,Aupgrade list
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP and a mayor said they were both
OL,7,Fdisappointed but would not "give up",
OL,8,Fafter the Department for Transport
OL,9,F(DfT) said it did not have any money to
OL,10,Fpay for the A10 to be dualled, between
OL,11,FCambridge and Ely.
OL,13,FThe government has written to local
OL,14,Fpoliticians to say the proposed scheme
OL,15,Foffered "lower value for money"
OL,16,Fcompared to other projects across
OL,17,FEngland.
OL,19,FCharlotte Cane, the Liberal Democrat MP
OL,20,Ffor Ely and East Cambridgeshire, has
OL,21,Furged the department to reconsider.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
