OL,3,GNEWSADisappointment as A10 removed from
OL,4,Aupgrade list
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservative mayor for the county, Paul
OL,7,FBristow, said he would look at
OL,8,F"alternative revenue sources" to try
OL,9,Fand get the congested road upgraded.
